B. Use .replaceOne() to replacing the entire document with a new document
db.users.replaceOne(
{ "name": "Bob" }, //searching criteria
{ "name": "Bob", "age": 26, "email":
"bob@example.com" } //new dokumen
)


C. Use .dropDatabase() to delete your entire database


D. How to Export to .json format

1. Collection Geografi
mongoexport --db=db_054872864_Tugas2 --collection=Geografi --out=Geografi.json

2. Collection Kependudukan
mongoexport --db=db_054872864_Tugas2 --collection=Kependudukan --out=Kependudukan.json

3.Coleection Ekonomi
mongoexport --db=db_054872864_Tugas2 --collection=Ekonomi --out=Ekonomi.json

Note!
Adjust the database name to your respective database name, fill it in according to your collection name, 
and for the out section, also fill it in according to your needs.
